message: "If you use this review or its datasets, cite the repository and the underlying studies."
title: "Whey Protein Powders: An Independent Scientific Investigation"
abstract: >-
  A source-first review of whey protein formulations, protein quality, dosing, additives, flavour
  variation, contaminants, third-party certification, safety and cost across 17 leading products,
  with reproducible datasets and validation scripts.
